playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/4321c5364000eb1e5751900eb5624fee.poster.avif?t=1750262679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/4321c5364000eb1e5751900eb5624fee.webm?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/4321c5364000eb1e5751900eb5624fee.mp4?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features of the PC version \ud83d\udca3</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Better graphics quality<br></li><li>Better sound effects<br></li><li>Better performance<br></li><li>Advanced player settings<br></li><li>Full Xbox controller support<br></li><li>Additional side missions</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "After a crime detective wakes up from a coma, he finds himself stuck in a dark basement with a bunch of bombs, and now he must use them to solve puzzles and find a way out.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/ba51d8e8c2dc786e9699abd4bda89cd2.poster.avif?t=1750262679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/ba51d8e8c2dc786e9699abd4bda89cd2.webm?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/ba51d8e8c2dc786e9699abd4bda89cd2.mp4?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find a way out! \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</h2>Challenge your puzzle-solving abilities in a mysterious world full of challenges.<br><br>Push boxes, carry bombs and take advantage of the environment around you, to find out what happened to you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/acc8b3ea8af17a7acdba8eca2863d3c2.poster.avif?t=1750262679\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/acc8b3ea8af17a7acdba8eca2863d3c2.webm?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2206590/extras/acc8b3ea8af17a7acdba8eca2863d3c2.mp4?t=1750262679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve the Puzzles \ud83d\udd0e</h2>Solve puzzles and challenges distributed over 25 different rooms, which will get more difficult as you progress in the game.<br><br>Make use of the dialogues to build a logical solution to the puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi